Because the Bodhi materials include a NoDerivs condition, and because aligned
full-text extraction may be considered a derivative or adapted form, this
public package excludes all human translation text and aligned human-reference
files. Availability from a cited source does not imply permission to
redistribute aligned full-text copies.

